{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18054","headline":"送陆畅归江南 · 韩愈","name":"送陆畅归江南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"举举江南子，名以能诗闻。\n一来取高第，官佐东宫军。\n迎妇丞相府，夸映秀士羣。\n鸾鸣桂树间，观者何缤纷。\n人事喜颠倒，旦夕异所云。\n萧萧青云干，遂逐荆棘焚。\n岁晚鸿雁过，乡思见新文。\n践此秦关雪，家彼吴洲云。\n悲啼上车女，骨肉不可分。\n感慨都门别，丈夫酒方醺。\n我实门下士，力薄蚋与蚊。\n受恩不即报，永负湘中坟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18054.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18054","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}